39 Proper maintenance is recommended before and after each use:
- Check the steam release valve, steam release pipe, anti-block shield and float valve on the pressure cooking lid for clogging;
- Check the heating element and element cover on the air fryer lid for grease and food debris; Prior to inserting the inner pot into the multi cooker base, make sure both parts are dry and free of food debris;  Let the appliance cool to room temperature before cleaning or storage. Do not allow children to clean or maintain the unit. See Care, cleaning and storage for more information.

